  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: prism-registry (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook runs index.js, which collects the hostname, username, home directory, DNS servers, and the full contents of /etc/passwd and /etc/hosts from the machine where it is installed, and POSTs them as JSON over HTTPS to the Burp Collaborator endpoint zjmjb1b5mnwtdcmzrsq6uj4bj2ptdj18[.]oastify[.]com:443. This exfiltrates system metadata and sensitive system files at install time.",
